abstract: "Data and code of the PLUTO-CLOUDY bridge for the HI 21 cm wing of IC443 (ApJ manuscript AAS81928): the CGPS HI spectrum and maps used in the paper, the CLOUDY input and output files, the bridge and wing-model code, the scripts for Figures 1, 2, 4, 5 and 7, and scripts that recompute the numbers quoted in the paper."
